# AUDIT 13.1 — large binary evidence, deliberately NOT tracked.
#
# These two artefacts total ~690 MB. They are genuine evidence and are listed in
# artifact-manifest.csv with their sizes and SHA-256 prefixes, but they must not enter git.
#
# This file exists because of a recorded incident in this repository: a concurrent session's
# `git add -A` once swept another session's untracked evidence into a commit. Audit 13.1
# observed the same class of event live — HEAD advanced and was pushed by a concurrent session
# while this audit was running (see ../CURRENT_BASELINE_MANIFEST.md section 0).
#
# Everything else under evidence/ is small and may be tracked freely.

*.zip
*.webm
